\uc0\u8232 Now, recall that computers represent characters using ASCII, a standard that represents each character as a number.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
